cff-version: 1.2.0
title: GeoFVBridge
message: "If you use GeoFVBridge, please cite this software."
type: software
abstract: >-
  GeoFVBridge is a solver-independent preprocessing toolkit that converts
  conforming Gmsh meshes and Petrel-exported ECLIPSE grids into cell-centred
  finite-volume topology and geometry
  for geological models.
authors:
  - name: GeoFVBridge contributors
version: 1.1.2
date-released: 2026-09-25
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.21522917
    description: Concept DOI for all GeoFVBridge versions.
keywords:
  - finite volume
  - Gmsh
  - geoscience
  - mesh preprocessing
  - TOUGH2
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/ZetangLi/GeoFVBridge
